## Proposed Changes

### Backend Web API

#### [MODIFY] [AuthenticationController.cs](file:///c:/Users/win11/Documents/GitHub/GraduationProject/API/src/Web.Api/Controllers/AuthenticationController.cs)
- Add private helper methods `SetRefreshTokenCookie(string refreshToken)` and `DeleteRefreshTokenCookie()`:
  - Configure the cookie options with `HttpOnly = true`, `Secure = true`, `SameSite = SameSiteMode.Lax`, `Expires` matching token lifetime (30 days), and `Path = "/"`.
- Update `Login` endpoint:
  - If authentication is successful, set the cookie via `SetRefreshTokenCookie`.
  - Return `UserResponse` with `RefreshToken` parameter set to `""`.
- Update `Register` endpoint:
  - If registration is successful, set the cookie via `SetRefreshTokenCookie`.
  - Return `UserResponse` with `RefreshToken` parameter set to `""`.
- Update `RefreshToken` endpoint:
  - Read the refresh token from request cookies: `Request.Cookies["refreshToken"]`.
  - If null/empty, return `Unauthorized`.
  - Call the authentication service to get new tokens.
  - Set the new refresh token in the cookie.
  - Return `UserResponse` with `RefreshToken` parameter set to `""`.
- Update `Logout` endpoint:
  - Call `DeleteRefreshTokenCookie` to instruct the browser to delete the cookie.

