### Frontend Angular App

#### [MODIFY] [auth.service.ts](file:///c:/Users/win11/Documents/GitHub/GraduationProject/Front-End/src/app/core/services/auth.service.ts)
- Update `login` method:
  - Add `withCredentials: true` option in the post call to allow receiving the HTTP cookie.
  - Remove all lines that save `res.refreshToken` to local storage.
- Update `register` method:
  - Add `withCredentials: true` option in the post call to allow receiving the HTTP cookie.
  - Remove all lines that save `res.refreshToken` to local storage.
- Update `refreshToken` method:
  - Add `withCredentials: true` option in the post call to allow sending and receiving the HTTP cookies.
  - Change the request body to an empty object `{}` since the refresh token is now automatically sent in the cookie header.
  - Remove all lines that read or save `eventora_refresh_token` from/to local storage.
- Update `logout` method:
  - Add `withCredentials: true` option in the HTTP post call to revoke the token and delete the cookie on the server.
  - Remove references to deleting `eventora_refresh_token` from local storage.
- Update `getRefreshToken` method:
  - Return `null` as the refresh token is no longer stored client-side.
- Remove references to `eventora_refresh_token` in constructor error handling.

